1.1.8 this manifest contains no Product Task, hours, schedule, completion claim, approval, risk acceptance, VetoSet, materialization permit, Git permission or Provider permission.

## 1.2 Record contract

1.2.1 every record has exactly ten fields: `findingId`, `severity`, `locator`, `defect`, `impact`, `requiredRemediation`, `safeTerminal`, `sourceBasis`, `status`, `mergeKey`.

1.2.2 `findingId` is report-local and immutable. Similar topic, common source, shared remediation or common safe terminal does not authorize Merge, Alias, closure transfer or parent credit.

1.2.3 `mergeKey` must equal `findingId`. Any duplicate ID/key, missing field, stale subject root or source-review mismatch yields `MANIFEST-REJECTED`.

1.2.4 this manifest intentionally does not create an acceptance predicate. Remediation text is a required design correction, not proof that the correction exists.

